@title Shorts in a drawn cooling tower are listed in Issues: PE on a phase, two phases bridged at a breaker
@area Checks
# The fixture is the cooling tower drawing with the two mistakes of the laptop report (finding 3):
# a feed named L1 on the drive's PE pin, and a stray wire between two poles of the group breaker -F4.
# Before the checks looked at nets, both showed "No issues".
open qa/fixtures/cooling-tower-shorts.novo
wait 20
shot schematic
click_text "2 errors"
wait 10
expect "Protective earth pin of"
expect "joined by the poles of"
shot issues
check_layout
